
Issue3545.agda:14.1-16.6: warning: -W[no]PragmaCompileErased
The backend JS erases createElem so the COMPILE pragma will be
ignored.

Issue3545.agda:18.1-44: warning: -W[no]PragmaCompileErased
The backend GHC erases createElem so the COMPILE pragma will be
ignored.

Issue3545.agda:27.1-51: warning: -W[no]PragmaCompileDefined
The GHC backend will use the COMPILE pragma instead of the
definition of map, so its compiled behaviour may differ from its
behaviour during type checking.
